---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="高性价比人生指南（测试）"
	description="¥1 解锁完整版 · 静态付费解锁演示"
>
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-5 py-10 sm:py-14">
		<a href="/" class="text-sm text-slate-500 transition hover:text-indigo-600">← 返回首页</a>

		<header class="mt-6">
			<span
				class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full bg-amber-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-amber-800"
			>
				测试资料 · 模拟解锁
			</span>
			<h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
				高性价比人生指南（测试）
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
				一份面向普通人的「少花钱、多办事」实用清单。先看免费预览，付 ¥1
				（演示）后解锁全文，并下载 PDF / Word 版本。
			</p>
		</header>

		<!-- Free teasers -->
		<section class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6">
			<h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">免费预览</h2>
			<ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-slate-700">
				<li class="flex gap-3">
					<span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-100 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">1</span>
					<span>先砍掉「订阅制浪费」：一年能省出一趟短途旅行的钱。</span>
				</li>
				<li class="flex gap-3">
					<span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-100 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">2</span>
					<span>用「复利清单」代替冲动消费：同类商品只买一次、用十年。</span>
				</li>
				<li class="flex gap-3">
					<span class="mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-100 text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700">3</span>
					<span>健康与时间也是资产：睡眠、运动、专注，比折扣更值钱。</span>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<!-- Locked / unlocked content -->
		<section class="relative mt-8" id="paywall-section">
			<!-- Locked state -->
			<div id="locked-panel">
				<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-sm">
					<div class="select-none p-5 blur-sm sm:p-6" aria-hidden="true">
						<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">完整版目录</h2>
						<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
							第一章：钱怎么花才不冤。订阅审计表、年化成本换算、三件套原则……第二章：时间复利。深度工作日程模板、开会预算、通勤置换……第三章：健康账本。睡眠、饮食、体检清单与「少花钱的医疗决策」。
						</p>
						<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
							附录含可打印表格与 Word 可编辑模板，方便你按自己的城市与收入改一版。
						</p>
						<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
							解锁后可下载 PDF 与 Word。本段仅为模糊预览占位。
						</p>
					</div>
					<div
						class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-t from-white via-white/90 to-white/40 px-5 text-center"
					>
						<svg
							class="h-10 w-10 text-slate-400"
							fill="none"
							viewBox="0 0 24 24"
							stroke="currentColor"
							stroke-width="1.5"
							aria-hidden="true"
						>
							<path
								stroke-linecap="round"
								stroke-linejoin="round"
								d="M16.5 10.5V6.75a4.5 4.5 0 10-9 0v3.75m-.75 11.25h10.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H6.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v6.75a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25z"
							></path>
						</svg>
						<p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700">内容已锁定</p>
						<p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">支付 ¥1 后查看完整版并下载文件</p>
						<button
							type="button"
							id="unlock-btn"
							class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm transition hover:bg-indigo-500 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-400 focus:ring-offset-2 active:scale-[0.98]"
						>
							支付 ¥1 解锁完整版
						</button>
						<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-amber-700">演示模式：点击即解锁，不会真实扣款</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Unlocked state (hidden by default) -->
			<div id="unlocked-panel" class="hidden">
				<div class="rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-emerald-800">
					✓ 已解锁（演示）· 本机记住解锁状态，刷新仍可见
				</div>

				<article class="mt-6 space-y-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6">
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">完整版正文</h2>

					<section>
						<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800">一、钱怎么花才不冤</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
							把所有自动续费列成表：流媒体、云盘、会员、App。按「每月实际打开次数」排序，低于 2
							次的先停。年化一下你会发现，很多「才几十块」其实够买一双好鞋或一次体检。
						</p>
						<p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
							买东西前问三句：用一年以上吗？有没有二手/借用？同类家里已经有没有？三句过关再下单。
						</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800">二、时间也是资产</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
							给深度工作留固定窗口（例如每天 90
							分钟），手机放另一个房间。把会议当成「花钱」：半小时会 = 你时薪的一半，能邮件解决就不开会。
						</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800">三、健康账本</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
							睡眠优先于宵夜；走路优先于办卡不练的健身房。每年一次基础体检，比临时急诊便宜且安心。这份指南的重点不是省到抠门，而是把钱和时间花在复利最高的地方。
						</p>
					</section>

					<p class="border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">
						以上为测试文案，正式版可换成你爸爸整理的真实 PDF / Word 内容。
					</p>
				</article>

				<!-- Fake downloads -->
				<div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm sm:p-6">
					<h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">下载完整资料</h3>
					<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">演示按钮：暂无真实文件，仅示意交互</p>
					<div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
						<button
							type="button"
							class="download-fake inline-flex flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 transition hover:border-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-50"
							data-fmt="PDF"
						>
							📄 下载 PDF
						</button>
						<button
							type="button"
							class="download-fake inline-flex flex-1 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 transition hover:border-indigo-300 hover:bg-indigo-50"
							data-fmt="Word"
						>
							📝 下载 Word
						</button>
					</div>
					<p id="download-toast" class="mt-3 hidden text-sm text-indigo-600" role="status"></p>
				</div>

				<button
					type="button"
					id="relock-btn"
					class="mt-6 text-xs text-slate-400 underline hover:text-slate-600"
				>
					清除解锁状态（方便再测）
				</button>
			</div>
		</section>

		<footer class="mt-12 border-t border-slate-200 pt-6 text-center text-xs text-slate-400">
			御神 · 付费解锁演示 · 无真实支付
		</footer>
	</main>

	<script>
		const STORAGE_KEY = 'yushen-guide-unlocked';

		const lockedPanel = document.getElementById('locked-panel');
		const unlockedPanel = document.getElementById('unlocked-panel');
		const unlockBtn = document.getElementById('unlock-btn');
		const relockBtn = document.getElementById('relock-btn');
		const toast = document.getElementById('download-toast');

		function showUnlocked() {
			lockedPanel?.classList.add('hidden');
			unlockedPanel?.classList.remove('hidden');
		}

		function showLocked() {
			unlockedPanel?.classList.add('hidden');
			lockedPanel?.classList.remove('hidden');
		}

		function unlock() {
			try {
				localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, '1');
			} catch (_) {}
			showUnlocked();
		}

		function relock() {
			try {
				localStorage.removeItem(STORAGE_KEY);
			} catch (_) {}
			showLocked();
		}

		// Restore unlock state
		try {
			if (localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) === '1') {
				showUnlocked();
			}
		} catch (_) {}

		unlockBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
			unlockBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');
			unlockBtn.textContent = '解锁中…';
			setTimeout(() => unlock(), 400);
		});

		relockBtn?.addEventListener('click', relock);

		document.querySelectorAll('.download-fake').forEach((btn) => {
			btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
				const fmt = btn.getAttribute('data-fmt') || '文件';
				if (toast) {
					toast.textContent = '（演示）' + fmt + ' 下载链接稍后接入真实文件。';
					toast.classList.remove('hidden');
				}
			});
		});
	</script>
</Layout>
